## tool.input

### instruction
Retain source policies, attributed claims, and input references in derived values.

### use_for
The tool-example application may originate values, attach claims, execute registered
tools, and release workflow results for the calculation purpose. Ordinary values
may be disclosed to console.

### do_not_use_for
Other applications, purposes, operations, or disclosure destinations.

### consequences
Keep signed records of decisions, tool results, and disclosures.

### on_violation_or_error
Record the refusal or failure and stop the protected operation.

## operation.records

### instruction
Retain signed decisions and operation records for verification by the endpoint.

### use_for
Verification and inspection by this endpoint.

### do_not_use_for
Treating an attributed claim as an endorsement by another source.

### consequences
Retain the writer, subject, requested use, and operation.

### on_violation_or_error
Reject records whose signatures, context, or sequence fail verification.
